{"@context":{"dcat":"http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#","dct":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/","foaf":"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/","xsd":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"},"@graph":[{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:08b223e12e001d9d3e92b7eca75d771275c86ba0c280db2e5f738c69bf49a9e0_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:08b223e12e001d9d3e92b7eca75d771275c86ba0c280db2e5f738c69bf49a9e0_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-05-11T00:00:00"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:08b223e12e001d9d3e92b7eca75d771275c86ba0c280db2e5f738c69bf49a9e0_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3/resource/6351d2cc-1657-43eb-b112-b8408c700529"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":" Capacity Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":" aFRR CM"},{"@language":"en","@value":" automatic Frequency Restoration Reserve"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Capacity "},{"@language":"en","@value":"aFRR Capactiy Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"aFRR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"afrr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Automatisk frekvensåterställningsreserv"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR CM"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"afrr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitet "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitetsmarknad"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/afrr_capacity_market"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT1H"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Presented data includes marginal prices in EUR/MW and volumes of contracted capacity for aFRR up and aFRR down in each respective bidding zone.\n\n\nFor more information about aFRR, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\n\nFor more information in _Swedish_, please see:  \n[aFRR- Automatic Frequency Restoration Reserve](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)\n\n\nCurrently, only hours with local procurement in Sweden are published. We are working on developing a dataset that will include information for all hours with procurement. For full details, please see:  \n[ENTSO-E Transparency Platform](https://transparency.entsoe.eu/balancing/capacity/volumesAndPricesContracted)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Presenterad data innehåller marginalpriser i EUR/MW och volym på avropad kapacitet för aFRR upp respektive aFRR ned i respektive elområde.\n\nFör mer information om aFFR, vänligen se:  \n[aFRR - Automatisk frekvensåterställningsreserv](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)\n\n\nFör närvarande publiceras enbart timmar med avrop i Sverige. Vi arbetar på att ta fram ett dataset som innehåller information om alla timmar med upphandling. För komplett information, vänligen se:  \n[ENTSO-E Transparensplattform](https://transparency.entsoe.eu/balancing/capacity/volumesAndPricesContracted)"}],"dct:identifier":"cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-08"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-13T01:13:22"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:08b223e12e001d9d3e92b7eca75d771275c86ba0c280db2e5f738c69bf49a9e0_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"aFRR Capacity Market"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR kapacitetsmarknad "}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan "}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3/resource/6351d2cc-1657-43eb-b112-b8408c700529","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3/resource/6351d2cc-1657-43eb-b112-b8408c700529"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/6351d2cc-1657-43eb-b112-b8408c700529"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3/resource/6351d2cc-1657-43eb-b112-b8408c700529/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Presented data includes marginal prices in EUR/MW and volumes of contracted capacity for aFRR up and aFRR down in each respective bidding zone.\n\n\nFor more information about aFRR, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\n\nFor more information in _Swedish_, please see:  \n[aFRR- Automatic Frequency Restoration Reserve](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)\n\n\nCurrently, only hours with local procurement in Sweden are published. We are working on developing a dataset that will include information for all hours with procurement. For full details, please see:  \n[ENTSO-E Transparency Platform](https://transparency.entsoe.eu/balancing/capacity/volumesAndPricesContracted)\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Presenterad data innehåller marginalpriser i EUR/MW och volym på avropad kapacitet för aFRR upp respektive aFRR ned i respektive elområde.\n\nFör mer information om aFRR, vänligen se:  \n[aFRR - Automatisk frekvensåterställningsreserv](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)\n\n\nFör närvarande publiceras enbart timmar med avrop i Sverige. Vi arbetar på att ta fram ett dataset som innehåller information om alla timmar med upphandling.\nFör komplett information, vänligen se: [ENTSO-E Transparensplattform](https://transparency.entsoe.eu/balancing/capacity/volumesAndPricesContracted)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-08T09:22:37"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-13T01:13:22"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3/resource/6351d2cc-1657-43eb-b112-b8408c700529/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"aFRR Capacity Market"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR kapacitetsmarknad "}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/6351d2cc-1657-43eb-b112-b8408c700529","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:08b223e12e001d9d3e92b7eca75d771275c86ba0c280db2e5f738c69bf49a9e0"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:0dd699dcdbaa4f436aad53aba684d10714d61b6c8a1ae2c2dd762fab1ce7af3b_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:0dd699dcdbaa4f436aad53aba684d10714d61b6c8a1ae2c2dd762fab1ce7af3b_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2020-01-01T00:00:00"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:0dd699dcdbaa4f436aad53aba684d10714d61b6c8a1ae2c2dd762fab1ce7af3b_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248/resource/72ef5ec0-d0d7-4d22-95e9-4f22b3048af4"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":" Capacity market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Capacity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Capacity Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Frequency Containment Reserve"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Prices"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Volumes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"fcr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frekvenshållningsreserv"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"fcr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"priser"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"volymer"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/fcr_capacity_market"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT1H"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"__This dataset is no longer updated.__\n\nPresented data includes  procured volumes (MW) of FCR balancing capacity from Swedish and Danish providers of ancillary services (BSPs).\n\n\nThe presented prices are the marginal price (EUR/MW) per procurement. The volume refers to the total contracted volume in the joint market with DK2. \n\n\nFor data before February 1, 2024, the published prices represent average prices in EUR/MW for contracted capacity for the products FCR-N, FCR-D up, and FCR-D down.\n\nFor FCR-D down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.__\n\nPresenterad data innehåller avropad volym (MW) FCR‑balanskapacitet från svenska och danska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP), per produkt och elområde. Presenterade priser är marginalpriset (EUR/MW) per upphandling. Volymen avser den totala avropade volymen på den gemensamma marknaden med DK2. \n\n\nFör data innan 1 Februari 2024 avser publicerade priser medelpriser i EUR/MW på avropad kapacitet för produkterna FCR-N, FCR-D upp och FCR-D ned. För FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[FCR-N, Frekvenshållningsreserv Normaldrift](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)"}],"dct:identifier":"cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-22"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:48:23"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2623032"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:0dd699dcdbaa4f436aad53aba684d10714d61b6c8a1ae2c2dd762fab1ce7af3b_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Capacity Market (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248/resource/72ef5ec0-d0d7-4d22-95e9-4f22b3048af4","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/dataset/cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248/resource/72ef5ec0-d0d7-4d22-95e9-4f22b3048af4"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/72ef5ec0-d0d7-4d22-95e9-4f22b3048af4"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248/resource/72ef5ec0-d0d7-4d22-95e9-4f22b3048af4/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"__This dataset is no longer updated.__\n\nPresented data includes  procured volumes (MW) of FCR balancing capacity from Swedish and Danish providers of ancillary services (BSPs).\n\n\nThe presented prices are the marginal price (EUR/MW) per procurement. The volume refers to the total contracted volume in the joint market with DK2. \n\nFor data before February 1, 2024, the published prices represent average prices in EUR/MW for contracted capacity for the products FCR-N, FCR-D up, and FCR-D down.\n\nFor FCR-D down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.__\n\n\nPresenterad data innehåller avropad volym (MW) FCR‑balanskapacitet från svenska och danska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP), per produkt och elområde. Presenterade priser är marginalpriset (EUR/MW) per upphandling. Volymen avser den totala avropade volymen på den gemensamma marknaden med DK2. \n\n\nFör data innan 1 Februari 2024 avser publicerade priser medelpriser i EUR/MW på avropad kapacitet för produkterna FCR-N, FCR-D upp och FCR-D ned. För FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[FCR-N, Frekvenshållningsreserv Normaldrift](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T07:32:38"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:48:23"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248/resource/72ef5ec0-d0d7-4d22-95e9-4f22b3048af4/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Capacity Market (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/72ef5ec0-d0d7-4d22-95e9-4f22b3048af4","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:0dd699dcdbaa4f436aad53aba684d10714d61b6c8a1ae2c2dd762fab1ce7af3b"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:12556eabf4d3554cd98490646ea395395e437477d5dc92ba6d24985d591f03ef_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:12556eabf4d3554cd98490646ea395395e437477d5dc92ba6d24985d591f03ef_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-01-01"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:12556eabf4d3554cd98490646ea395395e437477d5dc92ba6d24985d591f03ef_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea/resource/bbe7d8c7-912f-4665-99e0-74493c75f7ef"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":"Capacity Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Capacity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Capacity Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Frequency Containment Reserve"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Offered Volumes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Volumes."},{"@language":"en","@value":"fcr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frekvenshållningsreserv"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"erbjuden volym"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"fcr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"volym"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/fcr_accepted_aggregated_offers"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT1H"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"__This dataset is no longer updated.__\n\nPresented data includes aggregated offered volume (MW) of FCR balancing capacity from Swedish and Danish providers of ancillary services (BSPs), per auction and product.\n\nFor FCR-D down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see: https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.__\n\nPresenterad data innehåller aggregerad erbjuden volym (MW) FCR-balanskapacitet från svenska och danska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP), per upphandling och produkt.\n\nFör FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)\n"}],"dct:identifier":"9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-22"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:48:08"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:12556eabf4d3554cd98490646ea395395e437477d5dc92ba6d24985d591f03ef_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Accepted Aggregated Offers (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad, budvolymer (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea/resource/bbe7d8c7-912f-4665-99e0-74493c75f7ef","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/dataset/9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea/resource/bbe7d8c7-912f-4665-99e0-74493c75f7ef"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/bbe7d8c7-912f-4665-99e0-74493c75f7ef"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea/resource/bbe7d8c7-912f-4665-99e0-74493c75f7ef/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"__This dataset is no longer updated.__\n\nPresented data includes aggregated offered volume (MW) of FCR balancing capacity from Swedish and Danish providers of ancillary services (BSPs), per auction and product.\n\nFor FCR-D down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.__\n\nPresenterad data innehåller aggregerad erbjuden volym (MW) FCR-balanskapacitet från svenska och danska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP), per upphandling och produkt.\n\nFör FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[FCR-N, Frekvenshållningsreserv Normaldrift](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T08:57:03"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:48:08"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea/resource/bbe7d8c7-912f-4665-99e0-74493c75f7ef/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Accepted Aggregated Offers (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad, budvolymer (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/bbe7d8c7-912f-4665-99e0-74493c75f7ef","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:12556eabf4d3554cd98490646ea395395e437477d5dc92ba6d24985d591f03ef"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:2f5bd22033cfd3664370f441f1c617516ef1bec44f42145ad98fd160e6b6fdf6_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:2f5bd22033cfd3664370f441f1c617516ef1bec44f42145ad98fd160e6b6fdf6_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-10-18"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:2f5bd22033cfd3664370f441f1c617516ef1bec44f42145ad98fd160e6b6fdf6_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736/resource/0c56e30d-8fce-4c27-afc8-621c230ae34d"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":"Capacity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Capactiy Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"mFFR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"mFRR CM"},{"@language":"en","@value":"mFRR Capactiy Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"manual Frequency Restoration Reserve"},{"@language":"en","@value":"mfrr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"mFRR CM"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"mFRR kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"mFRR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"manuell Frekvensåterställningsreserv"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"mfrr"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/mfrr_capacity_market"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT1H"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Presented data includes marginal prices in EUR/MW and volumes of contracted capacity for mFRR  up and mFRR CM down in each respective bidding zone. Data is available from 2023-10-18, which is the first trading day for this market.\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[mFRR CM, mFRR capacity market](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/mfrr/)  \n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Presenterad data innehåller marginalpriser i EUR/MW och volym på avropad kapacitet för mFRR upp respektive mFRR ned i respektive elområde. Data finns från 2023-10-18, vilket är det första handelsdygnet för denna marknad.\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[mFRR CM, mFRR kapacitetsmarknad](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/mfrr/)  "}],"dct:identifier":"272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-01"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-13T01:08:33"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:2f5bd22033cfd3664370f441f1c617516ef1bec44f42145ad98fd160e6b6fdf6_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"mFRR Capacity Market"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"mFRR kapacitetsmarknad"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan "}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736/resource/0c56e30d-8fce-4c27-afc8-621c230ae34d","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736/resource/0c56e30d-8fce-4c27-afc8-621c230ae34d"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/0c56e30d-8fce-4c27-afc8-621c230ae34d"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736/resource/0c56e30d-8fce-4c27-afc8-621c230ae34d/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Presented data includes marginal prices in EUR/MW and volumes of contracted capacity for mFRR  up and mFRR CM down in each respective bidding zone. Data is available from 2023-10-18, which is the first trading day for this market.\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[mFRR CM, Manual Frequency Restoration Reserve Capacity Market](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/mfrr/)  \n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Presenterad data innehåller marginalpriser i EUR/MW och volym på avropad kapacitet för mFRR upp respektive mFRR ned i respektive elområde. Data finns från 2023-10-18, vilket är det första handelsdygnet för denna marknad.\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[mFRR CM, Manuell frekvensåterställningsreserv kapacitetsmarknad](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/mfrr/)  \n"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-01T08:47:14"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-13T01:08:33"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736/resource/0c56e30d-8fce-4c27-afc8-621c230ae34d/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"mFRR Capacity Market"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"mFRR Kapacitetsmarknad"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/0c56e30d-8fce-4c27-afc8-621c230ae34d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:2f5bd22033cfd3664370f441f1c617516ef1bec44f42145ad98fd160e6b6fdf6"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"https://data.svk.se","@type":"dcat:Catalog","dcat:dataset":[{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/272e2fa6-177d-4f58-98c7-74d3e63d7736"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/9b241617-255e-4942-ae0c-7240bb7aeaea"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cb9a1264-8ad3-46bb-983a-5ed554ca8ba3"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf76baaf-acfb-4b08-9f47-bd5775bc8248"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75"}],"dct:description":"Default CKAN portal","dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-13T09:08:28"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://svk.se"},"dct:title":"Svenska Kraftnät Data Service","foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:45b9a433cc3656544ed22c75ed076962cb8a861d908a40f9310ab2c6204189ce"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:7b3ae8a71b56586c5534f264b621fd5107414f45c3289be78d039809e0dc4229_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:7b3ae8a71b56586c5534f264b621fd5107414f45c3289be78d039809e0dc4229_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:endDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-04"},"dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-05-11T00:00:00"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:7b3ae8a71b56586c5534f264b621fd5107414f45c3289be78d039809e0dc4229_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca/resource/c0a75ee4-2cf3-43f2-9168-2c8627aef0ef"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Frequency Containment Reserve"},{"@language":"en","@value":"activated FCR energy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"activated energy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"energy"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aktiverad energi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aktiverad reglerenergi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"energi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"frekvenshållningsreserv"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"frekvensreglering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"frekvensstabilisering"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/fcr_activated_energy"},"dcat:spatialResolutionInMeters":{"@type":"xsd:decimal","@value":"1000.0"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT1H"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/NEVER"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"**This dataset is no longer updated.**\n\n\nThe presented data includes activated energy in MWh of FCR balancing energy from Swedish providers of ancillary services (BSPs). The presented prices refer to the balancing price (EUR/MWh). For FCR-D Down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"**Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.**\n\n\n Presenterad data innehåller aktiverad energi i MWh FCR-balansenergi från Svenska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP). Presenterade priser är reglerpriset (EUR/MWh). För FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[FCR-N, Frekvenshållningsreserv normaldrift](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)"}],"dct:identifier":"cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-08"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:47:55"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:7b3ae8a71b56586c5534f264b621fd5107414f45c3289be78d039809e0dc4229_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Activated Energy 60 min (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR aktiverad energi 60 min (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan "}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca/resource/c0a75ee4-2cf3-43f2-9168-2c8627aef0ef","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/dataset/cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca/resource/c0a75ee4-2cf3-43f2-9168-2c8627aef0ef"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/c0a75ee4-2cf3-43f2-9168-2c8627aef0ef"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca/resource/c0a75ee4-2cf3-43f2-9168-2c8627aef0ef/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"**This dataset is no longer updated.** \n\n\nThe presented data includes activated energy in MWh of FCR balancing energy from Swedish providers of ancillary services (BSPs). The presented prices refer to the balancing price (EUR/MWh).\n\n\n\nFor FCR-D Down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  \n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"**Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.**\n\n\n Presenterad data innehåller aktiverad energi i MWh FCR-balansenergi från Svenska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP). Presenterade priser är reglerpriset (EUR/MWh). För FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[FCR-N, Frekvenshållningsreserv Normaldrift](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-08T10:06:37"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:47:55"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf5a9105-1778-4460-86c6-e50bcd90fbca/resource/c0a75ee4-2cf3-43f2-9168-2c8627aef0ef/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Activated Energy 60 min (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR aktiverad energi 60 min (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/c0a75ee4-2cf3-43f2-9168-2c8627aef0ef","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:7b3ae8a71b56586c5534f264b621fd5107414f45c3289be78d039809e0dc4229"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:85959b3146b47afa3f39a049d9219e6ec32939e8504b439e0089ac064138519a_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:85959b3146b47afa3f39a049d9219e6ec32939e8504b439e0089ac064138519a_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-01-01"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:85959b3146b47afa3f39a049d9219e6ec32939e8504b439e0089ac064138519a_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f/resource/6093d167-dece-45c8-8ac7-d307e6ac45e9"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":"Capacity market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Capacity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Capacity Market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Frequency Containment Reserve"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Procured volumes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Volumes."},{"@language":"en","@value":"fcr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":" avropad volym"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frekvenshållningsreserv"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"fcr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"volym"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/fcr_capacity_market_aggregated"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT1H"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"**This dataset is no longer updated.** \n\nPresented data includes aggregated procured volumes (MW) of FCR balancing capacity from Swedish and Danish providers of ancillary services (BSPs), per auction.\n\nThe presented prices are the marginal price (EUR/MW) per procurement. The volume refers to the total contracted volume in the joint market with DK2. For the market labeled _Total_, the price represents a volume-weighted average of the marginal prices from _Procurement 1_ and _Procurement 2_, and the volume is the summed contracted volume from _Procurement 1_ and _Procurement 2_.\n\nFor data before February 1, 2024, the published prices represent average prices in EUR/MW for contracted capacity for the products FCR-N, FCR-D up, and FCR-D down.\n\nFor FCR-D down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  \n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"**Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.**\n\nPresenterad data visar aggregerad avropad volym (MW) FCR‑balanskapacitet från svenska och danska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP), per upphandling och produkt. \n\n\nPresenterade priser är marginalpriset (EUR/MW) per upphandling. Volymen avser den totala avropade volymen på den gemensamma marknaden med DK2. För marknad _Total_ avser priset ett volymviktat medel av marginalpriserna från _Upphandling 1_ och _Upphandling 2_, och volymen den summerade avropade volym från _Upphandling 1_ och _Upphandling 2_.\n\n\nFör data innan 1 Februari 2024 avser publicerade priser medelpriser i EUR/MW på avropad kapacitet för produkterna FCR-N, FCR-D upp och FCR-D ned. För FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[FCR-N, Frekvenshållningsreserv Normaldrift](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)"}],"dct:identifier":"cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-22"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:47:34"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:85959b3146b47afa3f39a049d9219e6ec32939e8504b439e0089ac064138519a_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Capacity Market Aggregated Volumes (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad, aggregerade volymer (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f/resource/6093d167-dece-45c8-8ac7-d307e6ac45e9","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/dataset/cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f/resource/6093d167-dece-45c8-8ac7-d307e6ac45e9"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/6093d167-dece-45c8-8ac7-d307e6ac45e9"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f/resource/6093d167-dece-45c8-8ac7-d307e6ac45e9/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"**This dataset is no longer updated.**\n\nPresented data includes aggregated procured volumes (MW) of FCR balancing capacity from Swedish and Danish providers of ancillary services (BSPs), per auction.\n\nThe presented prices are the marginal price (EUR/MW) per procurement. The volume refers to the total contracted volume in the joint market with DK2. For the market labeled _Total_, the price represents a volume-weighted average of the marginal prices from _Procurement 1_ and _Procurement 2_, and the volume is the summed contracted volume from _Procurement 1_ and _Procurement 2_.\n\nFor data before February 1, 2024, the published prices represent average prices in EUR/MW for contracted capacity for the products FCR-N, FCR-D up, and FCR-D down.\n\nFor FCR-D down, data is only available from after December 2021.\n\n\nFor further information, please see:  \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\nFor further information in *Swedish*, please see:   \n[FCR-N, Frequency Containment Reserve - Normal](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Down, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Down regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Up, Frequency Containment Reserve - Disturbance Up regulation](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)  \n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"**Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.**\n\n\nPresenterad data visar aggregerad avropad volym (MW) FCR‑balanskapacitet från svenska och danska leverantörer av stödtjänster (BSP), per upphandling och produkt. \n\n\nPresenterade priser är marginalpriset (EUR/MW) per upphandling. Volymen avser den totala avropade volymen på den gemensamma marknaden med DK2. För marknad _Total_ avser priset ett volymviktat medel av marginalpriserna från _Upphandling 1_ och _Upphandling 2_, och volymen den summerade avropade volym från _Upphandling 1_ och _Upphandling 2_.\n\n\nFör data innan 1 Februari 2024 avser publicerade priser medelpriser i EUR/MW på avropad kapacitet för produkterna FCR-N, FCR-D upp och FCR-D ned. För FCR-D ned finns enbart data efter december 2021.\n\n\nFör mer information läs,  \n[FCR-N, Frekvenshållningsreserv Normaldrift](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-n/)  \n[FCR-D Ned, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning nedreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-ned/)  \n[FCR-D Upp, Frekvenshållningsreserv Störning uppreglering](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/fcr-d-upp/)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T08:42:06"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:47:34"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf4a57dd-22a0-4b97-8911-0815d7a35e5f/resource/6093d167-dece-45c8-8ac7-d307e6ac45e9/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FCR Capacity Market Aggregated Volumes (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR kapacitetsmarknad, aggregerade volymer (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/6093d167-dece-45c8-8ac7-d307e6ac45e9","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:85959b3146b47afa3f39a049d9219e6ec32939e8504b439e0089ac064138519a"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9d6420c581b95b709d17770e4e8fa9badf5de5e299e8f97aa6361d263ca62818_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:9d6420c581b95b709d17770e4e8fa9badf5de5e299e8f97aa6361d263ca62818_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-01-01"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:9d6420c581b95b709d17770e4e8fa9badf5de5e299e8f97aa6361d263ca62818_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75/resource/cf392ef3-7345-4e98-970e-83088c185570"},"dcat:keyword":"Svenska kraftnät","dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/market_data_day_ahead_area_prices"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT15M"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/UPDATE_CONT"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"This dataset contains day-ahead electricity prices for Sweden and neighboring countries.\n\nThe day-ahead market facilitates trading of electricity for delivery the following day, with prices set for each bidding zone (SE1, SE2, SE3, and SE4 in Sweden). Prices are determined through the marginal pricing model, meaning they reflect the cost of meeting the final unit of demand. As a result, prices vary between different periods depending on overall supply and demand conditions."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detta dataset innehåller priser från dagen före‑marknaden för Sverige och angränsande länder.\n\nDagen före‑marknaden möjliggör handel med el för leverans nästkommande dag, där priser fastställs för varje elområde (SE1, SE2, SE3 och SE4 i Sverige). Priserna bestäms genom marginalprissättning, vilket innebär att de speglar kostnaden för att producera den sista kilowattimmen som behövs för att matcha efterfrågan. Som en följd varierar priserna mellan olika tidsperioder beroende på utbud och efterfrågan.\n\nLäs mer om dagenföre-marknaden på SVK:s hemsida: [Dagen före-marknaden – fysisk handel med el | Svenska kraftnät](https://www.svk.se/om-kraftsystemet/om-elmarknaden/dagen-fore-marknaden--fysisk-handel-med-el/)"}],"dct:identifier":"e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-09"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-08T10:13:24"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2623032"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/3144096"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/597427"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/660013"}],"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:9d6420c581b95b709d17770e4e8fa9badf5de5e299e8f97aa6361d263ca62818_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Market data day-ahead prices (Currently not updating, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dagen före-priser per elområde (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan "}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75/resource/cf392ef3-7345-4e98-970e-83088c185570","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75/resource/cf392ef3-7345-4e98-970e-83088c185570"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/cf392ef3-7345-4e98-970e-83088c185570"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75/resource/cf392ef3-7345-4e98-970e-83088c185570/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"**Please note that data is not updated as of 1 July 2026. Data may also be missing for certain time periods and bidding zones. Svenska kraftnät is working to resolve the issue.**\n\nThis dataset contains day-ahead electricity prices in EUR/MWh for Sweden and neighboring countries.\n\nThe day-ahead market facilitates trading of electricity for delivery the following day, with prices set for each bidding zone (SE1, SE2, SE3, and SE4 in Sweden). Prices are determined through the marginal pricing model, meaning they reflect the cost of meeting the final unit of demand. As a result, prices vary between different periods depending on overall supply and demand conditions."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"**Observera att data inte uppdateras efter 1 juli 2026. Data kan även saknas för vissa tidpunkter och elområden. Svenska kraftnät arbetar med att åtgärda problemet**\n\nDetta dataset innehåller priser i EUR/MWh från dagen före‑marknaden för Sverige och angränsande länder.\n\nDagen före‑marknaden möjliggör handel med el för leverans nästkommande dag, där priser fastställs för varje elområde (SE1, SE2, SE3 och SE4 i Sverige). Priserna bestäms genom marginalprissättning, vilket innebär att de speglar kostnaden för att producera den sista kilowattimmen som behövs för att matcha efterfrågan. Som en följd varierar priserna mellan olika tidsperioder beroende på utbud och efterfrågan.\n\nLäs mer om dagen före-marknaden på SVK:s hemsida: [Dagen före-marknaden – fysisk handel med el](https://www.svk.se/om-kraftsystemet/om-elmarknaden/dagen-fore-marknaden--fysisk-handel-med-el/)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-09T06:26:54"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-08T10:13:24"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/e08d25e0-21c8-4a78-8fbf-a12aca497c75/resource/cf392ef3-7345-4e98-970e-83088c185570/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Market data day-ahead prices (Currently not updated, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dagen före-priser per elområde (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/cf392ef3-7345-4e98-970e-83088c185570","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:9d6420c581b95b709d17770e4e8fa9badf5de5e299e8f97aa6361d263ca62818"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:bc62a758d8a20ce3fa91318f2a80e6462a16c257d512a352cf97e14b0463fc77_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:bc62a758d8a20ce3fa91318f2a80e6462a16c257d512a352cf97e14b0463fc77_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:endDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-04"},"dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2021-01-01T00:00:00"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:bc62a758d8a20ce3fa91318f2a80e6462a16c257d512a352cf97e14b0463fc77_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171/resource/f40313df-c68c-420a-a655-1ea8ffda2859"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":"Energy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"aFRR Energy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"aFRR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"afrr"},{"@language":"en","@value":"automatic Frequency Restoration Reserve"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Energi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR Energi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"afrr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"automatisk Frekvensåterställningsreserv"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/afrr_activated_balancing_energy"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT1H"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/NEVER"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"__This dataset is no longer updated.__\n\n\nThe presented data includes activated aFRR energy in MWh for aFRR Up and aFRR Down in each respective bidding zone. The presented price is the balancing price in EUR/MWh, as activated aFRR energy is compensated according to the balancing price.\n\nFor further information, please see:     \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\n\nFor further information in _Swedish_, please see:  \n[Automatic Frequency Restoration Reserve](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.__\n\n\nPresenterad data inehåller aktiverad energi för aFRR i MWh för aFRR Upp respektive aFRR Ned i respektive elområde. Presenterat pris är reglerpriset i EUR/MWh då aktiverad energi för aFRR ersätts enligt reglerpriset. \n\n\nFör mer information om aFRR, vänligen se:     \n[Automatisk frekvensåterställningsreserv (aFRR)](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)"}],"dct:identifier":"cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-09"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:46:52"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:bc62a758d8a20ce3fa91318f2a80e6462a16c257d512a352cf97e14b0463fc77_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"aFRR Activated Balancing Energy 60 min (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR aktiverad energi 60 min (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan "}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171/resource/f40313df-c68c-420a-a655-1ea8ffda2859","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/dataset/cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171/resource/f40313df-c68c-420a-a655-1ea8ffda2859"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/f40313df-c68c-420a-a655-1ea8ffda2859"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171/resource/f40313df-c68c-420a-a655-1ea8ffda2859/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"__This dataset is no longer updated.__\n\nThe presented data includes activated aFRR energy in MWh for aFRR Up and aFRR Down in each respective bidding zone. The presented price is the balancing price in EUR/MWh, as activated aFRR energy is compensated according to the balancing price.\n\nFor further information, please see:     \n[Information on different ancillary services](https://www.svk.se/en/stakeholders-portal/electricity-market/provision-of-ancillary-services/information-on-different-ancillary-services/)\n\n\nFor further information in _Swedish_, please see:  \n[Automatic Frequency Restoration Reserve](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Det här datasetet uppdateras ej längre med ny data.__\n\nPresenterad data inehåller aktiverad energi för aFRR i MWh för aFRR Upp respektive aFRR Ned i respektive elområde. Presenterat pris är reglerpriset i EUR/MWh då aktiverad energi för aFRR ersätts enligt reglerpriset. \n\n\nFör mer information om aFRR, vänligen se:     \n[Automatisk frekvensåterställningsreserv (aFRR)](https://www.svk.se/aktorsportalen/bidra-med-reserver/om-olika-reserver/afrr/)\n"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-09T09:16:40"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-28T09:46:52"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/cf3d5b76-bbb8-42a4-a111-9cce6bd90171/resource/f40313df-c68c-420a-a655-1ea8ffda2859/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"aFFR Activated Balancing Energy 60 min (Discontinued, please read description)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"aFRR aktiverad energi 60 min (Uppdateras ej, se beskrivning)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/STABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/en_GB/datastore/dump/f40313df-c68c-420a-a655-1ea8ffda2859","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:bc62a758d8a20ce3fa91318f2a80e6462a16c257d512a352cf97e14b0463fc77"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:c5f3790153f2ba0825bb211843c9138bc1226705e011d1afb5b20a2b5ded5e04_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundbyberg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"17224","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Sturegatan 1"},{"@id":"_:c5f3790153f2ba0825bb211843c9138bc1226705e011d1afb5b20a2b5ded5e04_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-01-01"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity market - Open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elmarknadslösningar - Öppna data"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:c5f3790153f2ba0825bb211843c9138bc1226705e011d1afb5b20a2b5ded5e04_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sds@svk.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"tel:+46104758000"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/857/resource/51774df42a0f14dacaa11aee8f726c6a"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb/resource/4aa94b88-9f42-4f0a-a6a8-8e47aadc782a"},"dcat:keyword":["Svenska kraftnät",{"@language":"en","@value":"bidding zone border"},{"@language":"en","@value":"bidding zone"},{"@language":"en","@value":"capacity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"exchange"},{"@language":"en","@value":"physical flows"},{"@language":"en","@value":"power"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"effekt"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"elområde"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"elområdesgräns"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"fysiska flöden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kapacitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"överföring"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/net_cross_border_physical_flows"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT15M"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dcat:version":"1.0.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The presented data includes the measured physical flow between bidding zones in Sweden and to other countries. The data is presented in MW per market time unit (MTU). \n\nPlease note that data may be missing for certain borders and market time units. This occurs when there is no flow across the border, alternatively, if no measured data is available.\nThe values may differ from those presented on ENTSO-E’s Transparency Platform due to differences in the data source.\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Presenterad data innehåller det uppmätta fysiska flödet mellan elområden i Sverige och till utlandet. Data presenteras i MW per marknadstidsenhet. \n\nVänligen notera att data kan saknas för vissa gränser och marknadstidsenheter. Detta inträffar när det inte är något flöde på gränsen, alternativt om uppmätt data saknas.\nVärdena kan skilja sig från de som presenteras på ENTSO-E:s Transparensplattform på grund av skillnader i datakälla.\n"}],"dct:identifier":"c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-07-01"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-13T09:08:28"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2618425"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2673723"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2673730"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2692969"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2960313"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/3133880"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/3143244"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/597427"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/604490"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/660013"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/756135"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/779554"}],"dct:subject":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/grunddata/foretag"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:c5f3790153f2ba0825bb211843c9138bc1226705e011d1afb5b20a2b5ded5e04_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Physical Power Flows"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fysiska elflöden"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk, first edition "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk, första utgåvan "}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb/resource/4aa94b88-9f42-4f0a-a6a8-8e47aadc782a","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb/resource/4aa94b88-9f42-4f0a-a6a8-8e47aadc782a"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/4aa94b88-9f42-4f0a-a6a8-8e47aadc782a"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb/resource/4aa94b88-9f42-4f0a-a6a8-8e47aadc782a/schema"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The presented data includes the measured physical power flow between bidding zones in Sweden and to other countries. The data is presented in MW per market time unit (MTU). \n\nPlease note that data may be missing for certain borders and market time units. This occurs when there is no flow across the border, alternatively, if no measured data is available.\n\nThe values may differ from those presented on ENTSO-E’s Transparency Platform due to differences in the data source."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Presenterad data innehåller det uppmätta fysiska flödet av el mellan elområden i Sverige och till utlandet. Data presenteras i MW per marknadstidsenhet.\n\nVänligen notera att data kan saknas för vissa gränser och marknadstidsenheter. Detta inträffar när det inte är något flöde på gränsen, alternativt om uppmätt data saknas.\n\nVärdena kan skilja sig från de som presenteras på ENTSO-E:s Transparensplattform på grund av skillnader i datakälla."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-01T13:15:28"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-13T09:08:28"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/c3c20e0b-9b38-44b3-b289-b3ea26d266fb/resource/4aa94b88-9f42-4f0a-a6a8-8e47aadc782a/rights"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Physical Power Flows"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fysiska elflöden"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/datastore/dump/4aa94b88-9f42-4f0a-a6a8-8e47aadc782a","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"},{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004284","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the Swedish national authority responsible for operating and developing the electricity transmission system, acting as the system operator for the country’s power supply. The agency holds the copyright to this material and is responsible for its management, dissemination, and associated legal conditions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät is the authority responsible for ensuring that Sweden's transmission system for electricity is safe, environmentally sound and cost-effective – today and in the future."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är den statliga myndighet som ansvarar för det svenska transmissionsnätet för el och agerar systemansvarig för den nationella elförsörjningen. Myndigheten äger upphovsrätten till detta material och ansvarar för dess förvaltning, tillgängliggörande och rättsliga villkor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät är ett statligt affärsverk som är systemansvarig myndighet för kraftsystemet i Sverige och som förvaltar och utvecklar Sveriges transmissionsnät för el. Svenska kraftnät är också elberedskapsmyndighet och tillsynsvägledande myndighet i frågor om dammsäkerhet samt tillsynsmyndighet för elförsörjningens säkerhetsskydd. Svenska kraftnät bildades 1992."}],"dct:identifier":"202100-4284","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":[{"@id":"https://www.svk.se"},{"@id":"https://www.svk.se/"}],"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@svk.se"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnät"}]},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:c5f3790153f2ba0825bb211843c9138bc1226705e011d1afb5b20a2b5ded5e04"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/120be762-2ec6-432f-935c-c1c10a5a49c2"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/185ca0a0-5bbf-4f81-99df-2d54c3de3e7f"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/1956af64-cca5-4943-8e05-03dea2fb42f8"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/1f2bd1a0-930c-46b7-8c55-9629d9fa060f"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/231ab91b-44e1-4308-adb8-b2b7039cd6bf"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/37f1e17e-e728-47d3-b75f-4a06e11a1276"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/59994d3f-848a-404e-96a8-a437cc7929cf"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/5ac1a701-0197-4108-bedf-c831bcf4cd99"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/7d266415-e5ae-47c5-8282-3c129802beb1"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/9b7d5a2e-5387-4896-a809-134afced2b98"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/b33c2289-4dbb-4227-9d53-bdd78503876d"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/b379783f-4172-42f2-a92f-9c721511de04"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/bf4ed633-a1ce-4301-9021-3187297b1c42"},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/c20d445d-a417-40e9-bb24-0cc63087be75"}],"dcat:keyword":"Ontologies","dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk ontologies: BASE for general concepts and EMDO for electricity market data. Data is described uniformly, machine-readable and with clear concepts for easy interpretation and reuse."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk ontologier: BASE för generella begrepp och EMDO för elmarknadsdata. Data beskrivs enhetligt, maskinläsbart och med tydliga begrepp för enkel tolkning och återanvändning."}],"dct:identifier":"66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-01-14T21:41:23"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T09:34:53"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/organization/5d88617e-213c-4f70-9ea5-e47a96abd424"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska kraftnät’s Semantic Web Framework: BASE and EMDO ontologies"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnäts semantiska webbramverk: ontologierna BASE och EMDO"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/120be762-2ec6-432f-935c-c1c10a5a49c2","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/units.ttl"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining units of measure used by Svenska Kraftnät across datasets and data models. The scheme includes currency units (e.g. SEK, EUR), physical units (e.g. MW, MWh, Hz), and derived units such as price per unit (e.g. EUR/MWh, SEK/MW). Derived units are explicitly modelled through relationships to their component units and currencies.\nEach concept is described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, definitions, and where applicable, mappings to external standards such as QUDT. The scheme supports consistent representation, interoperability, and exchange of measurement and pricing information across systems and data domains in the electricity market."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar måttenheter som används av Svenska kraftnät i dataset och datamodeller. Schemat omfattar valutaenheter (t.ex. SEK, EUR), fysiska enheter (t.ex. MW, MWh, Hz) samt härledda enheter såsom pris per enhet (t.ex. EUR/MWh, SEK/MW). Härledda enheter modelleras explicit genom relationer till sina ingående enheter och valutor.\nVarje begrepp beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner samt, där det är tillämpligt, kopplingar till externa standarder såsom QUDT. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig representation, interoperabilitet och utbyte av mät- och prisinformation mellan system och datadomäner inom elmarknaden."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-28T12:36:52"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:55:12"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Units of Measure Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för måttenheter (units of measure)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/185ca0a0-5bbf-4f81-99df-2d54c3de3e7f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/productiontype.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"13712"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining specific types of electricity production used by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes detailed concepts such as biomass, fossil fuels (e.g. coal, gas, oil), nuclear power, hydropower variants, wind (onshore and offshore), solar, marine energy, and energy storage. Each concept is linked to broader production categories and described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent classification, interoperability, and exchange of detailed generation data across systems and data domains in the electricity market."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar specifika typer av elproduktion som används av Svenska kraftnät. Schemat omfattar detaljerade begrepp såsom biomassa, fossila bränslen (t.ex. kol, gas och olja), kärnkraft, olika typer av vattenkraft, vindkraft (land- och havsbaserad), solkraft, marin energi samt energilagring. Varje begrepp är kopplat till överordnade produktionskategorier och beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig klassificering, interoperabilitet och utbyte av detaljerad produktionsdata mellan system och datadomäner inom elmarknaden."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:41:06"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:51:53"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Production Type Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för kraftslag (production type)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/1956af64-cca5-4943-8e05-03dea2fb42f8","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/reservedirection.ttl"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining the direction of reserve activation in balancing services used by Svenska Kraftnät. It includes concepts for upward, downward, and symmetric reserve directions, each with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent interpretation and exchange of directional information for reserve products across systems in the electricity market domain."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar riktningen för aktivering av reserver inom balanstjänster hos Svenska kraftnät. Det omfattar begrepp för uppreglering, nedreglering samt symmetrisk aktivering, inklusive identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig tolkning och utbyte av riktningsinformation för reservprodukter mellan system inom elmarknadsdomänen."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T09:44:40"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:34:52"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Reserve Direction Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för effektriktning (reserve direction)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/1f2bd1a0-930c-46b7-8c55-9629d9fa060f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/biddingzone.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"9054"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining bidding zones used in the Nordic and European electricity markets, as applied by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes concepts for Swedish bidding zones (SE1–SE4), the Nordic system price, and interconnected zones such as Norway, Denmark, Finland, the Baltic states, Poland, and Germany-Luxembourg. Each concept is provided with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent identification and exchange of geographical market areas across systems and data domains."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar elområden i den nordiska och europeiska elmarknaden enligt Svenska kraftnäts tillämpning. Schemat omfattar svenska elområden (SE1–SE4), det nordiska systempriset samt sammankopplade elområden såsom Norge, Danmark, Finland, Baltikum, Polen och Tyskland-Luxemburg. Varje begrepp innehåller identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig identifiering och utbyte av geografiska marknadsområden mellan system och datadomäner."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:35:17"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:40:06"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bidding Zone Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för elområden (bidding zone)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/231ab91b-44e1-4308-adb8-b2b7039cd6bf","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/reserveproduct.ttl"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining reserve product types used by Svenska Kraftnät. It includes concepts such as FCR-N, FCR-D, aFRR capacity market, mFRR capacity market, and mFRR energy activation market, each with multilingual labels and definitions to support harmonised interpretation across systems."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar typer av reservprodukter som används av Svenska kraftnät. Det omfattar begrepp såsom FCR-N, FCR-D, aFRR kapacitetsmarknad, mFRR kapacitetsmarknad och mFRR energimarknad, med flerspråkiga etiketter och definitioner för att stödja en harmoniserad tolkning mellan system."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T09:41:02"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:20:55"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Reserve Product Type Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för balanstjänsttyper (reserve product)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/37f1e17e-e728-47d3-b75f-4a06e11a1276","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/base.ttl"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svenska Kraftnät’s semantic framework is based on a modular structure in which the base ontology, BASE, serves as a common foundation. By gathering general and domain-independent concepts in BASE, the more specialised Electricity Market Data Ontology (EMDO) can focus on electricity market data while following a shared approach to modelling information.\n\nThis makes it possible to describe published datasets in a consistent and machine-readable way. Instead of publishing data solely as columns and values, the information is linked to clearly defined concepts, properties, code lists, and relationships. This makes it easier for both humans and systems to understand what the data actually represents.\n\nThe goal is to facilitate interpretation, combination, and reuse of data from Svenska Kraftnät’s Data Service.\n\n***\n\n## Purpose and usage\n\nThe ontologies have been developed to:\n\n* establish a common semantic structure for published datasets\n* enable machine-readable interpretation of published data\n* facilitate links between different data sources\n* support interoperability with national and international systems\n* clarify the concepts, units, and code lists used\n* make it easier for developers, analysts, and other data consumers to use the data correctly\n\nTo simplify the connection between ontologies and actual datasets, column names are documented as alternative labels on classes and properties. However, the meaning itself is defined in the ontology through classes, relationships, and links to code lists and external concepts.\n\n***\n\n## Architecture and structure\n\nThe framework consists of two main parts:\n\n* BASE – common base ontology\n* EMDO – electricity market data\n\nBASE contains reusable building blocks, while EMDO specialises these for the electricity market domain. In addition, code lists complement the ontologies by defining valid data values.\n\n***\n\n## 1. Base ontology (BASE)\n\n<https://data.svk.se/ontology/base>\n\nA foundational ontology providing reusable and domain-independent concepts and data structures used across Svenska Kraftnät’s domain ontologies. The ontology defines core entities such as time series values, observations, forecasts, units of measure, currencies, geographical areas, and countries, along with associated properties for describing values, temporal validity, and units. It also establishes modelling patterns for linking data to controlled vocabularies via code lists. The ontology supports semantic consistency, interoperability, and reuse of shared definitions across systems, datasets, and electricity market applications.\n\nBASE contains general concepts that can be used across many types of datasets, particularly those with time-dependent values.\n\n### Time series values\n\nThe class `base:TimeSeriesValue` is used as an overarching structure for values linked to time, such as observations and forecasts.\n\n### Observations and forecasts\n\nBASE distinguishes between different types of time-based values:\n\n* `base:Observation` – measured or calculated values published as actual results\n* `base:Forecast` – future-oriented estimates\n\nThis makes it clear whether a value describes an actual outcome or a prediction.\n\n### Units of measure\n\nA general model for units exists through `base:UnitOfMeasure` and specialisations such as:\n\n* power (`PowerUnit`)\n* energy (`EnergyUnit`)\n* frequency (`FrequencyUnit`)\n* currency (`CurrencyUnit`)\n\nThis separates the value itself from the unit in which it is expressed.\n\n***\n\n## 2. Electricity Market Data Ontology (EMDO)\n\n<https://data.svk.se/ontology/emdo>\n\n[Description of EMDO](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/7d266415-e5ae-47c5-8282-3c129802beb1)\n\nEMDO builds on BASE and describes concepts, properties, and data types related to electricity market data.\n\nIt is used to model data such as:\n\n* physical flows\n* transmission capacity\n* bids and imbalances\n* reserve markets\n* bidding zones and settlement\n\nEMDO defines more specific types of observations and forecasts, still based on BASE but tailored to the electricity market.\n\nExamples of concepts:\n\n* `emdo:BiddingZone`\n* `emdo:SynchronousArea`\n\n***\n\n## Code lists\n\nCode lists, also known as SKOS concept schemes, are used to define the valid values for certain properties, for example:\n\n* countries\n* bidding zones\n* production types\n* currencies\n\nThey are linked to properties via `base:hasCodeList`. This is primarily documentation; validation itself is handled separately, for example using SHACL. Where relevant, code list concepts can be linked to external standard concepts, such as QUDT units and currencies, using `skos:exactMatch`.\n\nCode lists (concept schemes) for Svenska Kraftnät:\n\n* [Balancing service types](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/231ab91b-44e1-4308-adb8-b2b7039cd6bf)\n* [Reserve direction](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/1956af64-cca5-4943-8e05-03dea2fb42f8)\n* [Auction rounds](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/9b7d5a2e-5387-4896-a809-134afced2b98)\n* [Bidding zones](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/1f2bd1a0-930c-46b7-8c55-9629d9fa060f)\n* [Country codes](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/5ac1a701-0197-4108-bedf-c831bcf4cd99)\n* [Dominant regulation direction](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/b33c2289-4dbb-4227-9d53-bdd78503876d)\n* [Forecast horizons](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/bf4ed633-a1ce-4301-9021-3187297b1c42)\n* [Interconnectors](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/c20d445d-a417-40e9-bb24-0cc63087be75)\n* [Production categories](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/b379783f-4172-42f2-a92f-9c721511de04)\n* [Production types](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/185ca0a0-5bbf-4f81-99df-2d54c3de3e7f)\n* [Trade action direction](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/59994d3f-848a-404e-96a8-a437cc7929cf)\n* [Units of measure](https://data.svk.se/en_GB/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/120be762-2ec6-432f-935c-c1c10a5a49c2)\n\n***\n\n## Semantics and inference\n\nThe ontologies enable systems to understand how datasets, concepts, and properties are related.\n\nFor example, specific classes in EMDO can be understood as specialisations of more general concepts in BASE. An electricity market observation can therefore be described both as a domain-specific concept and as a general observation according to the shared structure in BASE.\n\nThe framework thus supports basic semantic inference through class hierarchies, relationships, and links to code lists and external concepts. However, it is not currently designed as a comprehensive rule or validation system. The primary goal is to provide a clear, reusable, and machine-readable semantic structure for published open data.\n\n***\n\n## Versioning\n\nEach ontology has both a stable base IRI and a version IRI:\n\n#### BASE\n\n* Latest: <https://data.svk.se/ontology/base>\n* Version: <https://data.svk.se/ontology/base/v1.0.0/>\n\n#### EMDO\n\n* Latest: <https://data.svk.se/ontology/emdo>\n* Version: <https://data.svk.se/ontology/emdo/v1.0.0/>\n\nThe base IRI serves as the stable identifier, while the version IRI allows specific versions to be distinguished over time.\n\n***\n\n## Target audience\n\nThe combined ontology framework is intended for data consumers, analysts, system developers, information architects, and other stakeholders who want to understand, combine, or reuse Svenska Kraftnät’s open data.\n\nIt can be used to:\n\n* interpret published datasets machine-readably\n* build semantic integrations\n* combine data from multiple domains\n* create knowledge graphs\n* analyse time series data\n* understand the relationship between the physical structure of the power system and electricity market processes\n\n***\n\n## Summary\n\nBy publishing these ontologies openly, Svenska Kraftnät creates better opportunities for reuse, transparency, and interoperability.\n\nThis means that their data can not only be read, but also understood and linked with other data sources in a structured and meaningful way."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svenska kraftnäts semantiska ramverk bygger på en modulär struktur där basontologin, BASE, fungerar som en gemensam grund. Genom att samla generella och domänoberoende begrepp i BASE kan den mer specialiserade ontologin Electricity Market Data Ontology (EMDO) fokusera på elmarknadsdata samtidigt som den följer ett gemensamt sätt att modellera information.\n\nDetta gör det möjligt att beskriva publicerade datamängder på ett konsekvent och maskinläsbart sätt. I stället för att enbart publicera data som kolumner och värden kopplas informationen till tydligt definierade begrepp, egenskaper, kodlistor och relationer. På så sätt blir det enklare att förstå vad datan faktiskt representerar för både människor och system.\n\nMålet är att göra det lättare att tolka, kombinera och återanvända data från Svenska kraftnäts Data Service.\n\n---\n\n## Syfte och användning\n\nOntologierna är framtagna för att:\n\n* skapa en gemensam semantisk struktur för publicerade datamängder\n* möjliggöra maskinell tolkning av publicerade datamängder\n* underlätta kopplingar mellan olika datakällor\n* stödja interoperabilitet med nationella och internationella system\n* tydliggöra använda begrepp, enheter och kodlistor\n* göra det enklare för utvecklare, analytiker och andra datakonsumenter att använda datan korrekt\n\nFör att förenkla kopplingen mellan ontologier och faktiska datamängder dokumenteras kolumnnamn som alternativa etiketter på klasser och egenskaper. Själva betydelsen definieras dock i ontologin genom klasser, relationer och kopplingar till kodlistor och externa begrepp.\n\n---\n\n## Arkitektur och struktur\n\nRamverket består av två huvuddelar:\n\n* BASE - gemensam basontologi\n* EMDO - elmarknadsdata\n\nBASE innehåller återanvändbara byggstenar, medan EMDO specialiserar dessa för elmarknadsdomänen. Därutöver kompletterar kodlistor dessa ontologier med definitioner av giltiga datavärden.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Basontologin (BASE)\n\nhttps://data.svk.se/ontology/base\n\nEn grundläggande ontologi som tillhandahåller återanvändbara och domänoberoende begrepp samt datastrukturer som används i Svenska kraftnäts domänontologier. Ontologin definierar centrala entiteter såsom tidsserievärden, observationer, prognoser, måttenheter, valutor, geografiska områden och länder, tillsammans med tillhörande egenskaper för att beskriva värden, tidsmässig giltighet och enheter. Den etablerar även modelleringsmönster för att koppla data till kontrollerade vokabulärer via kodlistor. Ontologin stödjer semantisk konsekvens, interoperabilitet och återanvändning av gemensamma definitioner mellan system, dataset och tillämpningar inom elmarknaden.\n\nBASE innehåller generella begrepp som kan användas i flera olika typer av datamängder, särskilt datamängder med tidsbundna värden.\n\n### Tidsserievärden\n\nKlassen `base:TimeSeriesValue` används som en övergripande struktur för värden som är kopplade till tid, till exempel observationer och prognoser.\n\n### Observationer och prognoser\n\nBASE skiljer mellan olika typer av tidsbundna värden:\n\n* `base:Observation` – uppmätta eller beräknade värden som publiceras som konstaterade värden\n* `base:Forecast` – framtidsinriktade uppskattningar\n\nDet gör det tydligt om ett värde beskriver ett faktiskt utfall eller en prognos.\n\n### Måttenheter\n\nEn generell modell finns för enheter via `base:UnitOfMeasure` och specialiseringar som:\n\n* effekt (`PowerUnit`)\n* energi (`EnergyUnit`)\n* frekvens (`FrequencyUnit`)\n* valuta (`CurrencyUnit`)\n\nDetta håller isär själva värdet från den enhet det uttrycks i.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Elmarknadsontologin (EMDO)\n\nhttps://data.svk.se/ontology/emdo\n\n[Beskrivning av EMDO](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/7d266415-e5ae-47c5-8282-3c129802beb1)\n\nEMDO bygger vidare på BASE och beskriver begrepp, egenskaper och datatyper kopplade till elmarknadsdata.\n\nDen används för att modellera data om exempelvis:\n\n* fysiska flöden\n* överföringskapacitet\n* bud och obalanser\n* reservmarknader\n* elområden och nätavräkning\n\nEMDO definierar mer specifika typer av observationer och prognoser, som fortfarande bygger på BASE men är anpassade till elmarknaden.\n\nExempel på begrepp:\n\n* `emdo:BiddingZone`\n* `emdo:SynchronousArea`\n\n---\n\n## Kodlistor\n\nKodlistor, även kallat SKOS konceptschema, används för att ange vilka värden som ska användas för vissa egenskaper, till exempel:\n\n* länder\n* elområden\n* produktionstyper\n* valutor\n\nDe kopplas till egenskaper via `base:hasCodeList`. Detta är främst dokumentation, själva valideringen sker separat, till exempel med SHACL. Där det är relevant kan kodlistebegrepp kopplas till externa standardbegrepp, exempelvis QUDT:s enhets- och valutabegrepp, med `skos:exactMatch`.\n\nKodlistor (konceptscheman) för Svenska kraftnät:\n\n* [Balanstjänsttyper](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/231ab91b-44e1-4308-adb8-b2b7039cd6bf)\n* [Effektriktning](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/1956af64-cca5-4943-8e05-03dea2fb42f8)\n* [Upphandlingstillfällen](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/9b7d5a2e-5387-4896-a809-134afced2b98)\n* [Elområden](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/1f2bd1a0-930c-46b7-8c55-9629d9fa060f)\n* [Landskoder](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/5ac1a701-0197-4108-bedf-c831bcf4cd99)\n* [Dominerande regleringsriktning](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/b33c2289-4dbb-4227-9d53-bdd78503876d)\n* [Prognoshorisonter](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/bf4ed633-a1ce-4301-9021-3187297b1c42)\n* [Överföringsförbindelser](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/c20d445d-a417-40e9-bb24-0cc63087be75)\n* [Produktionskategorier](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/b379783f-4172-42f2-a92f-9c721511de04)\n* [Kraftslag](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/185ca0a0-5bbf-4f81-99df-2d54c3de3e7f)\n* [Riktning för handelsåtgärd](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/59994d3f-848a-404e-96a8-a437cc7929cf)\n* [Måttenheter](https://data.svk.se/sv/linkeddata_ontology/svk_ontologier/resource/120be762-2ec6-432f-935c-c1c10a5a49c2)\n\n---\n\n## Semantik och inferens\n\nOntologierna gör det möjligt för system att förstå hur olika datamängder, begrepp och egenskaper hänger ihop.\n\nExempelvis kan specifika klasser i EMDO förstås som specialiseringar av mer generella begrepp i BASE. En elmarknadsspecifik observation kan därmed både beskrivas som ett särskilt elmarknadsbegrepp och samtidigt förstås som en observation enligt den gemensamma strukturen i BASE.\n\nRamverket stödjer därmed enklare semantisk inferens genom klasshierarkier, relationer och kopplingar till kodlistor och externa begrepp. Det är däremot inte i nuläget utformat som ett omfattande regel- eller valideringssystem. Syftet är framför allt att skapa en tydlig, återanvändbar och maskinläsbar semantisk struktur för publicerad öppen data.\n\n---\n\n## Versionering\n\nVarje ontologi har både en stabil bas-IRI och en versions-IRI:\n\n#### BASE\n* Senaste: https://data.svk.se/ontology/base\n* Version: https://data.svk.se/ontology/base/v1.0.0/\n\n#### EMDO\n* Senaste: https://data.svk.se/ontology/emdo\n* Version: https://data.svk.se/ontology/emdo/v1.0.0/\n\nBas-IRI används som den stabila identifieraren för respektive ontologi, medan versions-IRI gör det möjligt att särskilja specifika versioner över tid.\n\n---\n\n## Målgrupp\n\nDet samlade ontologiramverket är avsett för datakonsumenter, analytiker, systemutvecklare, informationsarkitekter och andra aktörer som vill förstå, kombinera eller vidareanvända Svenska kraftnäts öppna data.\n\nRamverket kan användas för att:\n\n* tolka publicerade datamängder maskinellt\n* bygga semantiska integrationer\n* kombinera data från flera domäner\n* skapa kunskapsgrafer\n* analysera tidsseriedata\n* förstå relationen mellan kraftsystemets fysiska struktur och elmarknadens processer\n\n---\n\n## Sammanfattning\n\nGenom att publicera ontologierna öppet skapar Svenska kraftnät bättre möjligheter för återanvändning, transparens och interoperabilitet.\n\nDet gör att deras data inte bara kan läsas, utan också förstås och kopplas ihop med andra källor på ett strukturerat och meningsfullt sätt."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-13T16:44:47"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T09:34:08"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Base Ontology for Svk Core Concepts and Data Structures"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Basontologi för Svk gemensamma begrepp och datastrukturer"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/59994d3f-848a-404e-96a8-a437cc7929cf","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/tradeactiondirection.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2138"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining trade action directions used in balancing processes by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes concepts representing increases and decreases in trade volume. Each concept is described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent interpretation and exchange of trade-related actions across systems and data exchanges in the electricity balancing domain."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar riktning för handelsåtgärder inom balansering hos Svenska kraftnät. Schemat omfattar begrepp som representerar ökning och minskning av handelsvolym. Varje begrepp beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig tolkning och utbyte av handelsrelaterade åtgärder mellan system och datautbyten inom balansmarknadsdomänen."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:41:44"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:53:41"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trade Action Direction Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för riktning för handelsåtgärd (trade action direction)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/5ac1a701-0197-4108-bedf-c831bcf4cd99","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/countrycode.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3451"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining country codes used by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes standardized country identifiers based on ISO 3166, with concepts representing countries such as Sweden. Each concept is described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent representation and exchange of country information across systems and datasets within the electricity market domain."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar landskoder som används av Svenska kraftnät. Schemat baseras på standardiserade landskoder enligt ISO 3166 och innehåller begrepp som representerar länder såsom Sverige. Varje begrepp beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig representation och utbyte av landsinformation mellan system och dataset inom elmarknadsdomänen."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:37:18"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:41:29"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Country Code Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för landskoder (country codes)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/7d266415-e5ae-47c5-8282-3c129802beb1","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/emdo.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"77340"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A domain ontology for modelling electricity market data used by Svenska Kraftnät. The ontology defines classes and properties for representing observations, forecasts, market results, flows, prices, and system conditions across the electricity market.\n\nIt integrates core concepts from the base ontology with multiple controlled vocabularies (code lists), including bidding zones, production types, reserve products, interconnectors, and market classifications. The ontology establishes consistent modelling patterns for linking data to these vocabularies and for describing time series values, units, and contextual dimensions.\n\nIn addition, the ontology uses `skos:altLabel` to align semantic properties with dataset column names used in Svenska Kraftnät’s data publications. It thereby supports semantic interoperability, standardised data exchange, and consistent interpretation of electricity market data across systems and datasets."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En domänontologi för modellering av elmarknadsdata hos Svenska kraftnät. Ontologin definierar klasser och egenskaper för att representera observationer, prognoser, marknadsresultat, flöden, priser och systemtillstånd inom elmarknaden.\n\nDen integrerar centrala begrepp från basontologin med flera kontrollerade vokabulärer (kodlistor), såsom elområden, kraftslag, reservprodukter, överföringsförbindelser och marknadsklassificeringar. Ontologin etablerar konsekventa modelleringsmönster för att koppla data till dessa vokabulärer samt för att beskriva tidsserievärden, enheter och kontextuella dimensioner.\n\nDessutom använder ontologin `skos:altLabel` för att koppla semantiska egenskaper till kolumnnamn i de dataset som publiceras via Svenska kraftnäts datatjänster. Den stödjer därmed semantisk interoperabilitet, standardiserat datautbyte och enhetlig tolkning av elmarknadsdata mellan system och datamängder."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-01-14T21:41:40"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T09:34:53"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Svk Electricity Market Data Ontology"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svk ontologi för elmarknadsdata"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/9b7d5a2e-5387-4896-a809-134afced2b98","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/auctionround.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2619"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining auction rounds used for procuring balancing services by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme classifies specific procurement rounds, such as FCR Auction 1 and FCR Auction 2, including identifiers, multilingual labels, and definitions. It supports consistent identification and interpretation of auction intervals in data exchange and integration scenarios within the electricity market domain."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar upphandlingstillfällen för anskaffning av balanstjänster hos Svenska kraftnät. Schemat klassificerar specifika auktionsrundor, såsom FCR Upphandling 1 och FCR Upphandling 2, inklusive identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter och definitioner. Det möjliggör en konsekvent identifiering och tolkning av upphandlingsintervall vid datautbyte och integration inom elmarknadsdomänen."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:34:21"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:34:52"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Auction Round Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för upphandlingstillfällen (auction round)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/b33c2289-4dbb-4227-9d53-bdd78503876d","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/dominantregulationdirection.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"5285"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining the dominant regulation direction within a common balancing area as used by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes concepts for upward regulation, downward regulation, and cases where no dominant direction is present. Each concept is described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent interpretation and exchange of regulation direction information across systems and data exchanges in the electricity balancing domain."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar dominerande regleringsriktning inom ett samreglerat område enligt Svenska kraftnäts tillämpning. Schemat omfattar begrepp för uppreglering, nedreglering samt fall där ingen dominerande riktning förekommer. Varje begrepp beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig tolkning och utbyte av information om regleringsriktning mellan system och datautbyten inom balansmarknadsdomänen."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:38:37"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:43:49"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dominant Regulation Direction Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för dominerande regleringsriktning (dominant regulation direction)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/b379783f-4172-42f2-a92f-9c721511de04","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/productioncategory.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"4096"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining categories of electricity production used by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes concepts such as fossil, renewable, nuclear, energy storage, and other production types. Each concept is described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent classification and exchange of information on power generation sources across systems and data domains in the electricity market."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar kategorier av elproduktion som används av Svenska kraftnät. Schemat omfattar begrepp såsom fossil energi, förnybar energi, kärnkraft, energilagring samt övriga produktionstyper. Varje begrepp beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig klassificering och utbyte av information om kraftslag mellan system och datadomäner inom elmarknaden."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:40:31"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:51:04"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Production Category Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för produktionskategorier (production category)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/bf4ed633-a1ce-4301-9021-3187297b1c42","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/forecasthorizon.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3355"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining forecast horizons used for market forecasts and data publications by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes concepts such as current, intraday, and day-ahead forecasts, representing different temporal perspectives of forecast information. Each concept is described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions. The scheme supports consistent interpretation and exchange of time-related forecasting information across systems and data domains in the electricity market."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar prognoshorisonter för marknadsprognoser och datapubliceringar hos Svenska kraftnät. Schemat omfattar begrepp såsom aktuell prognos, intradag och dagen-före prognos, vilka representerar olika tidsmässiga perspektiv på prognosinformation. Varje begrepp beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner. Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig tolkning och utbyte av tidsrelaterad prognosinformation mellan system och datadomäner inom elmarknaden."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:39:08"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:44:46"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Forecast Horizon Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för prognoshorisonter (forecast horizon)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/dataset/66794d13-cd8e-4064-bcab-cc0a0cb0cf55/resource/c20d445d-a417-40e9-bb24-0cc63087be75","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/ontology/codelist/interconnector.ttl"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"6147"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A SKOS concept scheme defining physical power transmission links (interconnectors) used by Svenska Kraftnät. The scheme includes concepts for cross-border and internal transmission connections such as Fenno-Skan, Konti-Skan, NordBalt, Baltic Cable, and SwePol Link. Each concept is described with identifiers, multilingual labels, alternative labels, and definitions, including technical characteristics such as HVDC or AC connections. The scheme supports consistent identification and exchange of grid topology elements across systems and data domains in the electricity market."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett SKOS-konceptschema som definierar fysiska överföringsförbindelser (interconnectors) som används av Svenska kraftnät. Schemat omfattar begrepp för gränsöverskridande och interna kraftförbindelser såsom Fenno-Skan, Konti-Skan, NordBalt, Baltic Cable och SwePol Link. Varje begrepp beskrivs med identifierare, flerspråkiga etiketter, alternativa etiketter och definitioner, inklusive tekniska egenskaper såsom likström (HVDC) eller växelström (AC). Schemat möjliggör en enhetlig identifiering och utbyte av nätstrukturinformation mellan system och datadomäner inom elmarknaden."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-22T10:39:43"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T08:45:45"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Interconnector Concept Scheme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konceptschema för överföringsförbindelser (interconnector)"}]},{"@id":"https://data.svk.se/organization/5d88617e-213c-4f70-9ea5-e47a96abd424","@type":"foaf:Agent","foaf:name":"Ontologies"},{"@id":"https://docs.dataportal.se/dcat/3.0.1/en/","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP for Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP för Sverige"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DCAT-AP-SE"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:dfbd31b72ea8884f269448ad17e2d715f9318ab62b8b7297e8ecfe65100b6eab"}]}
